is widely used among developers working in that language.

  The "System Libraries" of an executable work include anything, other
than the work as a whole, that (a) enters into the packaging of a
Standard Interface with or adapted for use with executable work, but
(b) is not part of the work, and (c) serves only to enable use of the
work with that Standard Interface, or interface-compatible.

  In this license, a "System Library" does not cover the two categories
